#: ../../legacy/administration.rst:18
msgid ""
"To add endpoints (other nodes) to this page, click the \"Add OAI-PMH "
"Endpoint\" button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../legacy/administration.rst:22
msgid ""
"Details for adding EaaSI network nodes (i.e. the appropriate URLs for "
"each node) will be provided to node administrators for configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../legacy/administration.rst:25
msgid ""
"To fetch the available metadata/environments from other nodes, simply "
"click the \"Synchronize\" button next to the selected node endpoint. The "
"*Remote* tab on the :ref:`environments overview "
"<environments_overview_dev>` page should update accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../legacy/administration.rst:31
msgid "Other settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../legacy/administration.rst:34
msgid "Keyboard layout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../legacy/administration.rst:36
msgid ""
"In order to map expected input between the user and the emulator, the "
"EaaSI interface must know the user's keyboard layout. Under the Settings "
"menu, the \"Change Keyboard layout\" window allows for choosing the "
"user's appropriate language and keyboard layout from a number of provided"
" options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../legacy/administration.rst:44
msgid ""
"If no options are otherwise selected, EaaSI defaults to English (US) and "
"a generic QWERTY 105-key PC keyboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../legacy/demo_client.rst:6
