msgid ""
"Once you click \"Publish\", you will lose the \"Delete\" environment "
"option in the *Public* tab. Publishing cannot be undone via the EaaSI "
"interface, and it can not be easily undone (if it can at all) by systems "
"administrators or the EaaSI development team."
