#: ../../legacy/publishing.rst:65
msgid ""
"When the environment has been successfully published, it will move to the"
" *Public* sub-section of the environments overview. After their next sync"
" to the network, other nodes will be able to see and replicate this "
"environment via their *Remote* sub-section."
