#: ../../legacy/publishing.rst:75
msgid ""
"In the *Remote* sub-section of the environments overview, locate the "
"selected environment from another node to replicate to your local node, "
"and select \"Details\" from the Actions dropdown menu:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../legacy/publishing.rst:80
msgid ""
"On the environment details page, click the \"Replicate\" button in the "
