#: ../../legacy/resources.rst:107
msgid ""
"If the Base Environment is running a KVM-compatible operating system "
"(e.g. Windows XP), you can enable virtualization here."
msgstr ""

#: ../../legacy/resources.rst:110
msgid ""
"The \"Native Config\" field will specify the actual flags/options passed "
"to the underlying emulator according to the selected Hardware "
"Configuration template. You can edit the Hardware Configuration here "
"accordingly (consult each :ref:`emulator's <managing_emulators_dev>`) "
